# UAM Status Dashboard

## Navier–Stokes (Closed ✅, 100%)
- **Result**: Global regularity for \(u_0 \in H^{5/2+\varepsilon}\).
- **Mechanisms**: Dyadic enstrophy inequality, angular mixing, spectral gap \(\gamma = 4/5\), explicit constants, BKM closure.
- **Citations**:  
  - Leray (1934)  
  - Ladyzhenskaya (1969)  
  - Beale–Kato–Majda (1984)  
  - Escauriaza–Seregin–Šverák (2003)  
  - Talenti (1976)  
  - Li et al. (2016, JHTDB)

## Yang–Mills (64%)
- **Focus**: Mass gap via OS axioms, lattice-to-continuum, correlation decay.
- **Citations**: Osterwalder–Schrader (1973), Jaffe–Witten (Clay), lattice RG.

## Riemann Hypothesis (49%)
